EverQuest includes a few chat variables which are mostly useful for pronouns.

%m :: You, or your target's pet.

%o :: Outputs the objective gender-specific pronoun of your target (Him, Her, It).

%p :: Outputs the possessive gender-specific pronoun of your target (His, Her, Its).

%r :: The race of your target.

%s :: Outputs the subjective gender-specific pronoun for the target (He, She, It).

%t :: Outputs the name of your current target.